stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> planned : anchor planned (manual or AI import)
  planned --> drilled : drill log completed
  drilled --> grouted : grout log completed
  grouted --> tested : test result recorded
  planned --> notrequired : PM marks not-required
  drilled --> requiresredrill : redrill flagged
  requiresredrill --> drilled : redrilled (redrilledFrom link)
  tested --> [*]

  notrequired : not-required
  requiresredrill : requires-redrill

  note right of tested
    Overlays (independent of status):
    testType none/proof/performance/acceptance/…
    needsPmReview flag
    soft delete (deletedAt) → 30-day purge
  end note
